@startuml
title SEQ-07 - Realtime Private Lesson and Persisted Assessment
autonumber
actor User
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
participant OpenAI as "OpenAI Realtime / Report Model"
database DB as "product_gotit"

User -> Web: Open private lesson
Web -> GotIt: GET /private-lessons/setup?targetLanguageCode
GotIt -> Core: Authenticate + practice.play entitlement
GotIt -> DB: Load profile, preferences, roadmap, continuity, mastered words
GotIt --> Web: setup catalog/current state
User -> Web: Save preferences / choose roadmap
Web -> GotIt: PUT preferences / POST roadmaps
GotIt -> DB: Persist scoped configuration
User -> Web: Start lesson
Web -> GotIt: POST /private-lessons/realtime-sessions
opt Personal courseId supplied
  GotIt -> DB: Resolve approved course version, next lesson and recent homework
  GotIt -> GotIt: Bind objective, grammar, vocabulary and support language
end
GotIt -> DB: Resolve focus, milestone, evidence and vocabulary
GotIt -> OpenAI: Create short-lived Realtime client secret + bounded instructions
OpenAI --> GotIt: ephemeral secret/session configuration
GotIt -> DB: Insert lesson journal row (no server key/audio)
GotIt --> Web: lesson + ephemeral secret + response directives\nEach directive retains the complete teaching context
Web -> OpenAI: WebRTC offer authenticated by ephemeral secret
OpenAI --> Web: WebRTC answer + audio/data channel
loop Until duration/stop/disconnect
  User -> Web: Speech / mute / translate latest
  Web <-> OpenAI: Realtime audio and events
  Web -> Web: Collect bounded transcript turns
  Web -> Web: Track learner speech and actual audio playback
  opt Thinking interval elapsed, active/unmuted/visible/online, no pending response
    alt Fewer than two automatic hints without learner activity
      Web -> OpenAI: continuationEvent with context + unique event_id
      OpenAI --> Web: Fresh hint or next objective-based activity
    else Automatic hint budget exhausted
      Web --> User: Show Continue lesson action
      User -> Web: Continue when ready
    end
  end
end
Web -> OpenAI: Send wrap-up event
OpenAI --> Web: Recap and goodbye audio
Web -> GotIt: POST /private-lessons/:id/complete\nreason + duration + bounded turns
GotIt -> OpenAI: Structured report from untrusted turns
OpenAI --> GotIt: strengths/corrections/skills/next step
GotIt -> GotIt: Validate, normalize and assess evidence
opt Actual teaching and learner participation observed
  GotIt -> DB: Queue homework once by lesson ID with bounded teaching excerpts
  GotIt -> DB: Record course evidence with revision check and lesson deduplication
end
critical Complete lesson
  GotIt -> DB: Save report/continuity
  GotIt -> DB: Insert skill and milestone evidence
  GotIt -> DB: Update skill profiles, CEFR range/confidence, roadmap progress
end
GotIt --> Web: completed lesson/report
Web --> User: Short report, next step and homework action\nFull report in expandable details
note over Web,DB
Standard lessons start and continue in the target language;
support language is available on request. Absolute beginners receive bilingual teaching.
Explain and model before guided and independent practice; vary examples after success.
response.done is not playback completion. Stop recovery timers on dispose.
Raw microphone audio and provider secret are not persisted by GotIt.
Transcript turns are accepted only at explicit completion and are bounded.
Only bounded teaching excerpts are retained for homework.
Homework/course writes precede journal completion and are retry-safe,
not one shared transaction with the lesson journal.
end note
@enduml
